ugh a smart AI proxy, crawling API, managed scrapers and a Web MCP Server. No browsers or proxies to maintain. Start free." /><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://crawlbase.com/assets/images/open-graph/open-graph-index-43b38d2cbf.png" /><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Crawlbase: Web Data Infrastructure for Developers &amp; AI" /><meta name="twitter:creator" content="@Crawlbase" /><script type="application/ld+json">{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Organization",
  "name": "Crawlbase",
  "url": "https://crawlbase.com",
  "logo": "https://crawlbase.com/assets/images/crawlbase-logo@2x.png",
  "description": "Crawlbase is a web data infrastructure platform for developers, data teams, and AI builders to reliably access and extract real-time web data at scale. It provides tools such as a Crawling API and Smart AI Proxy to crawl websites, process JavaScript-heavy pages, and bypass anti-bot protections, while enabling retrieval-augmented workflows via the Web MCP Server and supporting large-scale crawling, storage, and automation.",
  "email": "support@crawlbase.com",
  "sameAs": ["https://github.com/crawlbase", "https://linkedin.com/company/crawlbase", "https://www.youtube.com/@CrawlbaseChannel"],
  "contactPoint": [
