}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "What is Crawlbase?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Crawlbase is web data infrastructure for developers, enterprises, and LLMs. It lets you crawl and scrape any website and receive clean, structured data through one platform, including a crawling API, a smart AI proxy, an enterprise crawler, managed scrapers, cloud storage, and a Web MCP Server for AI agents." } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "How does the Crawlbase web scraping API work?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "You send a URL to the API with your token. Crawlbase routes the request through a rotating residential proxy with the correct geolocation, renders the page when JavaScript is required, handles CAPTCHAs and bot checks automatically, and returns clean structured JSON." } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do I need to manage proxies or solve CAPTCHAs myself?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Proxy rotation, geotargeting, retries, rendering, and anti-bot handling all run inside the platform. You send a URL and receive structured data. There is nothing to wire together and nothing to maintain when a site changes its anti-bot setup." } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "Can Crawlbase provide web data to AI agents and LLMs?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. The Crawlbase Web MCP Server gives AI agents and LLMs live, structured web data through the Model Context Protocol, so your models and RAG pipelines can request and receive fresh web data directly." } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "How much does Crawlbase cost?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "You can start free with up to 5,000 requests and no credit card. After that, one pay as you go rate card covers the crawling API, smart AI proxy, scrapers, enterprise crawler, storage, and Web MCP Server, with optional subscriptions from $99 a month." } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "Can Crawlbase scale to millions of pages?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. For very large jobs, the asynchronous Enterprise Crawler uses callbacks to crawl millions of pages without you running any infrastructure." } }
  ]
}</script></head><body class="index landing"><nav id="nav" class="js-nav"><div class="wrap nav-inner"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="mark"><svg class="brand-mark-svg" viewBox="0 0 46 47" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect class="brand-mark-tile" x="0.8" y="1.3" width="44.4" height="44.4" rx="10.2"></rect><path class="brand-mark-wave" d="M27.6525 12.8821C26.2298 12.2988 24.7075 12 23.1568 12C21.6061 12 20.0981 12.2988 18.6612 12.8821C17.1816 13.4796 15.8443 14.3616 14.7062 15.4998L18.6612 19.4548C21.1366 16.9793 25.177 16.9793 27.6525 19.4548L31.6075 15.4998C30.4693 14.3616 29.1463 13.4796 27.6525 12.8821Z"></path><path class="brand-mark-wave" d="M18.6612 28.4463L14.7062 32.4013C15.8443 33.5394 17.1816 34.4215 18.6612 35.0332C20.0981 35.6165 21.6061 35.9011 23.1568 35.9011C24.7075 35.9011 26.2156 35.6023 27.6525 35.019C29.132 34.4215 30.4693 33.5394 31.6075 32.4013L27.6525 28.4463C25.177 30.936 21.1366 30.9217 18.6612 28.4463Z"></path><path class="brand-mark-dot" d="M15.574 27.0516C17.2947 27.0516 18.6896 25.6567 18.6896 23.936C18.6896 22.2152 17.2947 20.8203 15.574 20.8203C13.8532 20.8203 12.4583 22.2152 12.4583 23.936C12.4583 25.6567 13.8532 27.0516 15.574 27.0516Z"></path></svg></span>crawlbase</a><div class="nav-links"><div class="js-nav-item nav-item"><button class="js-nav-trigger nav-trigger" type="button" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" data-track-dropdown="products">Products<svg><use xlink:href="/assets/images/sprite-539325c6b9.symbol.svg#chevron-down"></use></svg></button><div class="nav-dropdown is-menu"><a class="nav-mi" href="/crawling-api-avoid-captchas-blocks"><span class="mi-name">Crawling API</span><span class="mi-desc">Scrape any page with JavaScript rendering and anti-bot handling.</span></a><a class="nav-mi" href="/anonymous-crawler-asynchronous-scraping"><span class="mi-name">Enterprise Crawler</span><span class="mi-desc">Asynchronous crawling at scale, delivered to storage.